47-e5aadd404d-web-3.8.0-2/grey-placeholder.png\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"><img sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 20vw, (min-width: 1008px) 25vw, (min-width: 800px) 33vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/5bf0/live/17079090-3f3e-11f1-b55d-0f258dce1735.jpg.webp 240w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/5bf0/live/17079090-3f3e-11f1-b55d-0f258dce1735.jpg.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/5bf0/live/17079090-3f3e-11f1-b55d-0f258dce1735.jpg.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/5bf0/live/17079090-3f3e-11f1-b55d-0f258dce1735.jpg.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/5bf0/live/17079090-3f3e-11f1-b55d-0f258dce1735.jpg.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/5bf0/live/17079090-3f3e-11f1-b55d-0f258dce1735.jpg.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/5bf0/live/17079090-3f3e-11f1-b55d-0f258dce1735.jpg.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/5bf0/live/17079090-3f3e-11f1-b55d-0f258dce1735.jpg.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"A screen capture from a video said to show the seizure of the container ships MSC Francesca and Epaminondas in the Strait of Hormuz\"></p></div></div><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\"><div><p><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\">Masked Iranian forces appear to seize ships in staged video</h2></p></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\">Analysis indicates that parts of the video appear to have been filmed hours after the ships were reportedly seized.</p><p><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-tag\">Middle East</span></p></div></div></a></div><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/videos/cly90z9g5q3o\" data-testid=\"internal-link\"><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-video\"><div data-testid=\"card-media-wrapper\"><div data-testid=\"card-media\"><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260602-053447-e5aadd404d-web-3.8.0-2/grey-placeholder.png\" aria-label=\"im